CC0 1.0 Universal — Public Domain Dedication

The AINRA conformance vectors in this directory (vectors/**) are dedicated to
the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain
Dedication. To the extent possible under law, the AINRA reference
implementation maintainers have waived all copyright and related or neighboring
rights to these conformance vectors.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Rationale (MTS §23, Standard 0.6): anyone must be able to claim conformance to
AINRA without asking permission. The vectors are the conformance definition;
they are therefore CC0, not Apache/MIT.
